  "title": "Featheral Gold (FTHG) · Utility token of Featheral World",
  "description": "Featheral Gold (FTHG) is the fixed-supply utility token of Featheral World. 216,265,000 FTHG — one per kilogram of the world's above-ground gold — exchangeable for in-game Featheral Dollars (FTH$).",
  "body": "<section class=\"hero\">\n  <img class=\"hero-logo\" src=\"/shared/logo-gold.svg\" alt=\"Golden feather\" width=\"112\" height=\"112\">\n  <h1 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2096\">Featheral Gold <span>FTHG</span></h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\" data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2140\">The fixed-supply utility token of <b>Featheral World</b>. One FTHG represents one kilogram of the world's above-ground gold — 216,265,000 tokens, never more.</p>\n  <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n    <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"#stats\">View live stats</a>\n    <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://etherscan.io/token/0xBa658127d93B17E577E1B8e8995cAB3aE7d7C665\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Etherscan ↗</a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"chain-pill\" data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2573\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Ethereum Mainnet · <code>0xBa65…C665</code></p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"cms-document-sections\">\n<section id=\"stats\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2741\">Live token statistics</h2>\n    <cms-widget name=\"statsUpdated\"></cms-widget>\n  </div>\n  <cms-widget name=\"primaryStats\"></cms-widget>\n  <div class=\"supply-card\">\n    <div class=\"supply-head\"><h3 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-2976\">Supply distribution</h3><small class=\"muted\" data-cms-copy=\"index-html-3004\">On-chain balances read at the same block</small></div>\n    <cms-widget name=\"supplyBar\"></cms-widget>\n    <cms-widget name=\"supplyLegend\"></cms-widget>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"economy\">\n  <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-3274\">FTHG ⇄ FTH$ game economy</h2>\n  <div class=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"flow-step\"><span>On-chain</span><b>FTHG</b><small data-cms-copy=\"index-html-3388\">ERC-20 on Ethereum Mainnet with a fixed supply.</small></div>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⇄</div>\n    <a class=\"flow-step highlight\" href=\"/conversion/\"><span>Fixed reserve rate</span><cms-widget name=\"rateValue\"></cms-widget><cms-widget name=\"rateNote\"></cms-widget></a>\n    <div class=\"flow-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⇄</div>\n    <a class=\"flow-step accent-dollar\" data-site=\"dollar\"><span>Layer 3</span><b>FTH$</b><small>Featheral Dollar — layer-3 currency with its own native block ledger. Open Featheral Dollar →</small></a>\n  </div>\n  <cms-widget name=\"economyStats\"></cms-widget>\n  <p class=\"muted fine\" data-cms-copy=\"index-html-4074\">FTH$ lives on the Featheral Dollar L3 ledger, not as an ERC-20 or a USD-redeemable asset. Finite off-chain allocations fund World markets automatically. Actual FTHG stays on Ethereum until manual settlement; only confirmed backing is redeemable. Market prices still respond to demand.</p>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"activity\">\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-4454\">Recent transfers</h2>\n    <a class=\"muted\" href=\"https://eth.blockscout.com/token/0xBa658127d93B17E577E1B8e8995cAB3aE7d7C665/token-transfers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">All transfers ↗</a>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n    <cms-widget name=\"table-1\"></cms-widget>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-4958\">Top holders</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n    <cms-widget name=\"table-2\"></cms-widget>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"contract\">\n  <h2 data-cms-copy=\"index-html-5285\">Contract</h2>\n  <div class=\"contract-card\">\n    <div><span class=\"muted\">Token address</span><cms-widget name=\"contractAddress\"></cms-widget></div>\n    <cms-widget name=\"copyAddress\"></cms-widget>\n  </div>\n  <dl class=\"facts\">\n    <div><dt>Name</dt><dd>Featheral Gold</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Symbol</dt><dd>FTHG</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Decimals</dt><dd>18</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Network</dt><dd>Ethereum Mainnet (chain 1)</dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <div class=\"links\">\n    <a href=\"https://etherscan.io/token/0xBa658127d93B17E577E1B8e8995cAB3aE7d7C665\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Etherscan ↗</a>\n    <a href=\"https://eth.blockscout.com/token/0xBa658127d93B17E577E1B8e8995cAB3aE7d7C665\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Blockscout ↗</a>\n    <a href=\"https://dexscreener.com/ethereum/0xBa658127d93B17E577E1B8e8995cAB3aE7d7C665\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DEX Screener ↗</a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.geckoterminal.com/eth/tokens/0xBa658127d93B17E577E1B8e8995cAB3aE7d7C665\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GeckoTerminal ↗</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>",
